      }
    },
    "Poki has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Poki repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 没有默认中转。请用 Poki 仓库中的 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh 把中转部署到你自己的 Cloudflare 账户，再输入它输出的地址。截图和轻点只经过这个中转。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is offline. Check that the phone has internet; Poki reconnects by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 已离线。请检查此 iPhone 的网络连接，Poki 会自动重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 需要你处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs the internet once after each restart of the phone to get Apple's signature for the developer disk image. Check Wi-Fi or cellular; Poki tries again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机每次重启后，Poki 需要联网一次，为开发者磁盘映像获取 Apple 的签名。请检查无线局域网或蜂窝网络，Poki 会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki needs your OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 需要你批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki shows steps, pairing codes, and approvals on the Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 会在锁定屏幕上显示操作步骤、配对码和批准请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki starts it again on the next agent request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体下次发出请求时，Poki 会重新启动它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki will open Settings. Go to **Privacy & Security › Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Poki**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki 将打开“设置”。前往“**隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式**”并轻点“**与 Poki 配对**”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port on 10.7.0.1": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
