          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Pair with Poki** and enter the code shown here and on the Lock Screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点“**与 Poki 配对**”，并输入此处或锁定屏幕上显示的配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Install Module, then confirm in Surge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点“安装模块”，然后在 Surge 中确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Install Plugin, then confirm in Loon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点“安装插件”，然后在 Loon 中确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Start, leave the app for a while, then return. The log records suspension gaps and connection closures.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点“开始”，离开 App 一段时间后再返回。日志会记录挂起时段及连接断开的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the chat with Mom": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点与妈妈的对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap “Send”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点“发送”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a relay address. Enter the address deploy.sh printed, such as https://poki-relay.you.workers.dev.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是中转地址。请输入 deploy.sh 输出的地址，例如 https://poki-relay.you.workers.dev。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Live Activity did not start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时活动未能启动：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer disk image did not install. Poki downloads it again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者磁盘映像未能安装，Poki 会自动重新下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer disk image is not downloaded yet (Setup > Pair). It is needed once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者磁盘映像尚未下载（设置引导 › 配对），只需下载一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time Poki Runner starts after a restart, iOS asks for your passcode to allow automation. Enter it once; Poki never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 重新启动后首次启动 Poki Runner 时，iOS 会要求输入锁屏密码以允许自动化操作。只需输入一次，Poki 无法读取该密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper app that taps and types for your agent. Poki starts it; you never open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "替智能体执行轻点和输入的辅助 App。由 Poki 自动启动，无需手动打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The latest screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最新画面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone no longer accepts Poki’s pairing (%@). Pair again in Setup; it takes a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone 不再接受 Poki 的配对（%@）。请在设置引导中重新配对，只需一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone no longer accepts this pairing: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iPhone 不再接受当前配对：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone refused the pairing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机拒绝了配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay forwards requests to this iPhone while Poki is open or in the background. It stores nothing; when offline, clients receive an error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 Poki 打开或在后台运行时，中转服务器会将请求转发至此 iPhone。服务器不存储任何数据；设备离线时，客户端会收到明确的错误提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runner starts when an agent asks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体发出请求时，Runner 会自动启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runner stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runner 已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This happens after a restore, a reset of Location & Privacy, or when the phone forgot Poki. Pair again; the old key is replaced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复 iPhone、还原“位置与隐私”或 iPhone 忘记 Poki 后会出现这种情况。重新配对即可，旧密钥会被替换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iOS version needs a newer developer disk image. Open Poki's setup to download the latest image, or update Poki.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iOS 版本需要更新的开发者磁盘映像。请打开 Poki 的设置引导下载最新映像，或更新 Poki。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
