      }
    },
    "Turn on Developer Mode: Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode, then restart the phone. If it is on: in Settings → General → VPN & Device Management, trust the developer of Poki Runner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启开发者模式：设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式，然后重启手机。如果已开启：在“设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理”中信任 Poki Runner 的开发者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Enhanced Mode (required for loopback).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启增强模式（回环仅在增强模式下可用）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on so your agents can use this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，智能体即可使用此 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the Poki Device Loopback module.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 Poki Device Loopback 模块。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the loopback in your proxy app: the Poki module in Surge or Loon, loopback_address in sing-box, or Shadowrocket's Settings → Other → \"Include route 10.7.0.1/32\". Then connect to Wi-Fi.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在代理 App 中开启回环：Surge 或 Loon 的 Poki 模块，sing-box 的 loopback_address，或 Shadowrocket 的“设置 › 其他 › 包含路由 10.7.0.1/32”。然后连接无线局域网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on your proxy app with the Poki module, or connect LocalDevVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在代理 App 中启用 Poki 模块，或连接 LocalDevVPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type it on the Pair with Poki screen in Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“设置”的“与 Poki 配对”页面输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type “On my way”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入“在路上了”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UI Automation is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启 UI 自动化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "USE YOUR PROXY APP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的代理 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for Approval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for Settings. Tap Pair with Poki there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待“设置”。请在“设置”中轻点“与 Poki 配对”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待智能体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the internet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待网络连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a free Apple ID, self-signed apps expire after 7 days and are limited to 3 at a time; Poki and Poki Runner use 2. Free accounts also can’t sign a VPN, so Loopback requires your proxy app or LocalDevVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用免费 Apple ID 自签名的 App 会在 7 天后过期，且最多同时安装 3 个（Poki 和 Poki Runner 占 2 个）。免费账户也无法签名 VPN，因此需要通过代理 App 或 LocalDevVPN 提供回环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在执行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents can use this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的智能体可以使用这台 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your proxy app's tunnel is on, but 10.7.0.1 is not reflected. Turn on the Poki module or route, then reconnect the proxy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理 App 的隧道已开启，但 10.7.0.1 没有被反射。请开启 Poki 模块或路由，然后重新连接代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failed: nothing changed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失败：画面无变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for the passcode before UI Automation after Poki Runner was force-closed or the iPhone restarted. Enter it once; Poki carries on by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poki Runner 被强制退出或 iPhone 重新启动后，iOS 会先要求输入锁屏密码，再允许 UI 自动化。只需输入一次，Poki 会自动继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS requires a background mode to keep apps running. Poki uses lowest-accuracy location and shows the location indicator while active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 要求 App 声明特定用途才能在后台持续运行。Poki 会以最低精度使用定位服务，并在运行期间显示定位指示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while the runner is active. Poki starts it when needed and stops it when idle. Don’t close Poki Runner while an agent is working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当 Runner 运行时，iOS 才会显示自动化横幅。Poki 会在智能体请求时启动它，并在闲置时停止。智能体工作期间请勿关闭 Poki Runner。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sending a message": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "setup-steps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个步骤"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
